From e3cc91d09b7914e2b0926740daf48f78606ba1ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Killy <308386066+killy-netsphere@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:42:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 107/211] layer-major prompt graph (LLAMA_LAYER_MAJOR=R): a
 prompt ubatch runs each layer's attention in blocks of R query rows and its
 FFN in blocks of LLAMA_LM_MOE_ROWS rows, so a layer's experts go up once a
 ubatch while the indexer's scores and masks stay [n_kv, R]; the masks are
 views of a causal staircase per device; decode() takes it for batches whose
 tokens sit at the cells of their positions (lm_positional), ubatches of
 ~1/LLAMA_LM_PIPE of the batch, the usual graph at LLAMA_LM_FALLBACK_UB rows
 otherwise

